"0\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px||true|false\" module_class=\"d-flex\" locked=\"off\" custom_margin=\"40px||||false|false\"][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"1_3\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\"]<p><strong>Table Grapes</strong> under the BARI® and LOGOLUSO® labels and standards<br /><strong>Stone Fruit</strong> such as peaches, nectarines, plums, pluots, cherries, and pomegranates.<br /><strong>Specialty &amp; Seasonal Varieties</strong> like our popular Crazy Apes™ extra large apricots that are all hand-picked and hand-packed.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"1_3\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"1_3\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-12 10:05:34', '2026-02-12 10:05:34', '', 12, 'https://bariproduce.com/?p=119', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
