<strong>Table Grapes</strong> under the BARI® and LOGOLUSO® labels and standards<br /><strong>Stone Fruit</strong> such as peaches, nectarines, plums, pluots, cherries, and pomegranates.<br /><strong>Specialty &amp; Seasonal Varieties</strong> like our popular Crazy Apes™ extra large apricots that are all hand-picked and hand-packed.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_button button_text=\"View All Our Products\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_bg_color=\"#612228\" button_bg_color__hover=\"#2C470E\" button_bg_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" button_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" button_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" button_border_width=\"2px\" button_border_color=\"#612228\" button_border_color__hover=\"#2C470E\" button_border_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" custom_padding=\"10px|40px|10px|20px|true|false\" button_border_radius=\"16px\" button_bg_enable_color=\"on\" hover_enabled=\"0\" button_bg_enable_color__hover=\"on\" transform_styles__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_scale__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_translate__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_rotate__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_skew__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_origin__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_translate_linked__hover=\"off\" transform_translate__hover=\"8px|0px\" button_on_hover=\"off\" animation_direction=\"top\" locked=\"off\" button_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"3_5\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][et_pb_gallery _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" gallery_ids=\"122,123\" show_title_and_caption=\"off\" show_pagination=\"off\" background__hover_enabled=\"on|desktop\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" orientation=\"portrait\" hover_icon=\"&#x2d;||divi||400\" hover_overla