=\"Bari Fruit Makes Your Shelves Look Good\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h2\" title_text_color=\"#0A0A0A\" title_font_size=\"36px\" custom_margin=\"||10px||false|false\" animation_direction=\"top\" title_font_size_tablet=\"32px\" title_font_size_phone=\"28px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font_size=\"20px\" text_text_color=\"#612228\" text_font=\"--et_global_body_font|500|||||||\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"]<p>The highest compliment is when we hear <em>“I saw your fruit in the store. It looked so good, I had to buy it!”</em></p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"#1A1A1A\" text_font=\"--et_global_body_font||||||||\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"]Our labels mean we are proud of our product. Not everything makes the cut, and that’s intentional. \nWe prioritize long-term relationships over short-term volume, and we protect the standards that buyers trust.[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_image src=\"https://bariproduce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/BariProduceGrapeBo.png\" alt=\"BariProduceGrapeBox\" title_text=\"BariProduceGrapeBox\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" hover_enabled=\"0\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" scroll_vertical_motion_enable=\"on\" scroll_vertical_motion=\"0|50|50|100|-0.5|0|0.5\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"][/et_pb_image][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_4,1_4,1_4,1_4\" use_custom_gutter=\"on\" make_equal=\"on\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" width=\"90%\" custom_margin=\"50px||||false|false\" custom_margin_tablet=\"50px||||false|false\" custom_margin_phone=\"0px||||false|false\" custom_margin_last_edited=\"on|phone\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px||true|false\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"01\" module_class=\"blurb-stroke\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" header_level=\"h2\" header_font=\"Inter|700|||||||\" header_text_align=\"left\" header_text_color=\"#612228\" header_font_size=\"80px\" body_font=\"Inter||||||||\" body_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" body_font_size=\"18px\" background_color=\"#612228\" height=\"100%\" custom_padding=\"20px|20px|20px|20px|true|true\" hover_enabled=\"0\" custom_css_free_form=\"selector h2{||  padding-bottom: 20px;||}\" header_text_shadow_style=\"preset5\" border_radii=\"on|12px|12px|12px|12px\" border_color_all=\"RGBA(255,255,255,0)\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" header_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" header_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\"]<p>Stronger displays that hold their shape.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"02\" module_class=\"blurb-stroke\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" header_level=\"h2\" header_font=\"Inter|700|||||||\" header_text_align=\"left\" header_text_color=\"#612228\" header_font_size=\"80px\" body_font=\"Inter||||||||\" body_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" body_font_size=\"18px\" height=\"100%\" custom_padding=\"20px|20px|20px|20px|true|true\" custom_css_free_form=\"selector h2{||  padding-bottom: 20px;||}\" header_text_shadow_style=\"preset5\" border_radii=\"on|12px|12px|12px|12px\" border_color_all=\"RGBA(255,255,255,0)\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" header_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\" header_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" background_color=\"#612228\"]<p>Fewer calls about condition or hold.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"03\" module_class=\"blurb-stroke\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" header_level=\"h2\" header_font=\"Inter|700|||||||\" header_text_align=\"left\" header_text_color=\"#612228\" header_font_size=\"80px\" body_font=\"Inter||||||||\" body_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" body_font_size=\"18px\" height=\"100%\" custom_padding=\"20px|20px|20px|20px|true|true\" custom_css_free_form=\"selector h2{||  padding-bottom: 20px;||}\" header_text_shadow_style=\"preset5\" border_radii=\"on|12px|12px|12px|12px\" border_color_all=\"RGBA(255,255,255,0)\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" header_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\" header_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" background_color=\"#612228\"]<p>Better sell-through and cleaner rotation.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_blurb title=\"04\" module_class=\"blurb-stroke\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" header_level=\"h2\" header_font=\"Inter|700|||||||\" header_text_align=\"left\" header_text_color=\"#612228\" header_font_size=\"80px\" body_font=\"Inter||||||||\" body_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" body_font_size=\"18px\" height=\"100%\" custom_padding=\"20px|20px|20px|20px|true|true\" custom_css_free_form=\"selector h2{||  padding-bottom: 20px;||}\" header_text_shadow_style=\"preset5\" border_radii=\"on|12px|12px|12px|12px\" border_color_all=\"RGBA(255,255,255,0)\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" header_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\" header_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" background_color=\"#612228\"]<p>Less mental load managing one more variable.</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-13 11:50:22', '2026-02-13 11:50:22', '', 12, 'https://bariproduce.com/?p=243', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
