sible\" custom_padding=\"80px||80px||true|false\" custom_padding_tablet=\"70px||70px||true|false\" custom_padding_phone=\"60px||60px||true|false\" custom_padding_last_edited=\"on|phone\"][et_pb_row _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" use_custom_gutter=\"on\" make_equal=\"on\" module_class=\"d-flex\" width=\"90%\" custom_margin=\"||||false|false\" custom_margin_tablet=\"50px||||false|false\" custom_margin_phone=\"0px||||false|false\" custom_margin_last_edited=\"on|phone\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px||true|false\"][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"4_4\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-13 11:55:13', '2026-02-13 11:55:13', '', 12, 'https://bariproduce.com/?p=248', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(249, 2, '2026-02-13 12:39:18', '2026-02-13 12:39:18', '<div class=\"custom-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"custom-col-6\"><label>[text* first-name placeholder \"Enter Your Name\"]</label></div>\r\n<div class=\"custom-col-6\"><label>[email* your-email placeholder \"Enter Your Email\"] </label></div>  \r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"custom-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"custom-col-12\">\r\n        <label><span style=\"display:none\">Buyer Type</span> [select* select-1 first_as_label \"Select Buyer Type\" \"New Buyer\" \"Returning Customer\"]</label>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"custom-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"custom-col-12\">    \r\n        [submit \"Sign Up for Seasonal Updates\"]\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\n1\nNew Seasonal Update Sign-Up — [first-name] just joined!\n[_site_title] <info@bariproduce.com>\njbedwell@bariproduce.com\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f9f3f4;font-family:Georgia,serif;\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- Header with Logo -->\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#61222829;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:30px 20px;\">\r\n        <img src=\"https://bariproduce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bari-color.png\" \r\n             alt=\"Bari Produce\" \r\n             style=\"max-width:180px;height:auto;display:block;\" />\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Main Card -->\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 20px;\">\r\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" \r\n               style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\r\n                      box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(97,34,40,0.10);max-width:600px;width:100%;\">\r\n\r\n          <!-- Greeting -->\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:40px 40px 20px 40px;\">\r\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:26px;color:#612228;font-family:Georgia,serif;\">\r\n                🎉 New Sign-Up Received!\r\n              </h1>\r\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;color:#555555;line-height:1.6;\">\r\n                Great news — someone just signed up for your seasonal updates. \r\n                Here are their details:\r\n              </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Divider -->\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:0 40px;\">\r\n              <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:2px solid #f9f3f4;margin:0;\">\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Contact Details -->\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:30px 40px;\">\r\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f9f3f4;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;\r\n                                 letter-spacing:1px;color:#999999;display:block;\r\n                                 margin-bottom:4px;\">Name</span>\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:17px;color:#222222;font-weight:bold;\">\r\n                      [first-name]\r\n                    </span>\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f9f3f4;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;\r\n                                 letter-spacing:1px;color:#999999;display:block;\r\n                                 margin-bottom:4px;\">Email Address</span>\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:17px;color:#612228;font-weight:bold;\">\r\n                      <a href=\"mailto:[your-email]\" \r\n                         style=\"color:#612228;text-decoration:none;\">[your-email]</a>\r\n                    </span>\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <td style=\"padding:10px 0;\">\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;\r\n                                 letter-spacing:1px;color:#999999;display:block;\r\n                                 margin-bottom:4px;\">Customer Type</span>\r\n                    <span style=\"font-size:17px;color:#222222;font-weight:bold;\">\r\n                      [select-1]\r\n                    </span>\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n\r\n              </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <!-- CTA Button -->\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:10px 40px 40px 40px;\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://app.constantcontact.com/pages/contacts/ui#contact-list\" \r\n                 style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#612228;color:#ffffff;\r\n                        text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:4px;\r\n                        font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,serif;\">\r\n                View in Constant Contact →\r\n              </a>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Footer -->\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"background-color:#f9f3f4;padding:24px 40px;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\r\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;line-height:1.6;\">\r\n                This contact has been automatically added to your Constant Contact list.<br>\r\n                Submitted via the sign-up form on \r\n                <a href=\"https://bariproduce.com\" \r\n                   style=\"color:#612228;text-decoration:none;\">bariproduce.com</a>\r\n              </p>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n\r\n        </table>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\nReply-To: [your-email]\n\n1\n1\n\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <wordpress@ashleyb97.sg-host.com>\n[your-email]\nMessage Body:\r\n[your-message]\r\n\r\n-- \r\nThis email is a receipt for your contact form submission on our website ([_site_title] [_site_url]) in which your email address was used. If that was not you, please ignore this message.\nReply-To: [_site_admin_email]\n\n1\n1\nThank you for signing up for our email list.  Look for seasonal updates and please contact us directly if you would like more information.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nOne or more fields have an error. Please check and try again.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nYou must accept the terms and conditions before sending your message.\nPlease fill out this field.\nThis field has a too long input.\nThis field has a too short input.\nThere was an unknown error uploading the file.\nYou are not allowed to upload files of this type.\nThe uploaded file is too large.\nThere was an error uploading the file.\nPlease enter a date in YYYY-MM-DD format.\nThis field has a too early date.\nThis field has a too late date.\nPlease enter a number.\nThis field has a too small number.\nThis field has a too large number.\nThe answer to the quiz is incorrect.\nPlease enter an email address.\nPlease enter a URL.\nPlease enter a telephone number.', 'Get In Touch', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'contact-form-1', '', '', '2026-05-08 07:27:09', '2026-05-08 07:27:09', '', 0, 'https://bariproduce.com/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&#038;p=249', 0, 'wpcf7_contact_form', '', 0);
