(290, 2, '2026-02-26 12:02:48', '2026-02-26 12:02:48', '[et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" background_color=\"#612228\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" custom_padding=\"100px||100px||true|false\" title_text=\"about_us_banner\" background_image=\"https://bariproduce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/about_us_banner-scaled.webp\" use_background_color_gradient=\"on\" background_color_gradient_stops=\"rgba(96,0,9,0.85) 0%|rgba(113,56,62,0.78) 99%\" background_color_gradient_overlays_image=\"on\" background_color_gradient_direction=\"120deg\"][et_pb_row _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" hover_enabled=\"0\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px||true|false\" width=\"90%\"][et_pb_column _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" type=\"4_4\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][et_pb_heading title=\"About Us\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_text_align=\"center\" title_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" title_font_size=\"56px\" width_tablet=\"100%\" width_phone=\"100%\" width_last_edited=\"on|tablet\" custom_margin=\"||0px||false|false\" hover_enabled=\"0\" title_font_size_tablet=\"42px\" title_font_size_phone=\"36px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" locked=\"off\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" custom_padding=\"||0px||false|false\"][/et_pb_heading][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" custom_padding_last_edited=\"on|phone\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" background_enable_image=\"off\" background_size=\"custom\" background_image_width=\"13%\" background_position=\"top_left\" background_horizontal_offset=\"-7%\" custom_padding=\"80px||80px||true|false\" custom_padding_tablet=\"70px||70px||true|false\" custom_padding_phone=\"60px||60px||true|false\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" locked=\"off\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][et_pb_row module_class=\"d-flex\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" width=\"90%\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px||true|false\" hover_enabled=\"0\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\"][et_pb_heading title=\"About Bari Produce\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h2\" title_font=\"--et_global_heading_font|--et_global_heading_font_weight|||||||\" title_text_color=\"#612228\" title_font_size=\"40px\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\" hover_enabled=\"0\" title_font_size_tablet=\"36px\" title_font_size_phone=\"34px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" title_text_align=\"center\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\" hover_enabled=\"0\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\" theme_builder_area=\"post_content\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" text_orientation=\"center\"]<p>Bari Produce is a family-owned produce company rooted in the San Joaquin Valley of Central California and built on generations of agricultural experience. We carry forward a family legacy rooted in farming, quality, and pride in the fruit we grow.<br />Our story traces back to Bari, Italy, where daily market shopping and fresh produce were a way of life. That tradition came with Panteleao Logoluso when he moved his family to Central California in the early 1900s and it continues today through the standards we uphold.<br />That mindset shaped the Bari® label more than 60 years ago. It still guides how we select, manage, and deliver fruit today so that we continue to deliver the best of the best in size, flavor, and quality. Then and now, it stands for the same thing: great-eating fruit you can regularly count on.<br />While the industry has grown more complex, our approach remains personal. We stay close to the fruit, close to our growers, and close to every order—because that’s how dependable results are delivered.<br />Our family’s history in farming and produce sales shapes how we operate today. We value long-term relationships. We believe consistency matters more than volume. And we take pride in delivering fruit that shows well, eats well, and arrives exactly as expected.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'About', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-26 12:02:48', '2026-02-26 12:02:48', '', 15, 'https://bariproduce.com/?p=290', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
