"36px\" header_5_font_size_phone=\"34px\" header_5_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" header_6_font_size_tablet=\"36px\" header_6_font_size_phone=\"34px\" header_6_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22header_2_text_color%22%93}\" sticky_enabled=\"0\" module_alignment=\"center\"]<h2>Our Growers Are <span class=\"clr-txt\">Third-Generation Farming Families</span>, Working Together</h2>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\" hover_enabled=\"0\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"]We partner with growers who share our values and our commitment to quality. Many are third-generation farming families with deep roots in Central California agriculture. These are relationships built over time, grounded in trust, and strengthened by shared standards.[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\" hover_enabled=\"0\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"]Our growers take pride in their land, their fruit, and their craft. We work closely with them throughout the season, staying involved from the field forward to ensure fruit meets the expectations tied to the Bari® and Logoluso® names.[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"2_5\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_image src=\"https://bariproduce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/PalmSpring2019-scaled.webp\" alt=\"PalmSpring2019\" title_text=\"PalmSpring2019\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" background_enable_color=\"off\" hover_enabled=\"0\" border_radii=\"on|12px|