nships built over time, grounded in trust, and strengthened by shared standards.[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"top\" animation_intensity_slide=\"10%\" hover_enabled=\"0\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"]Our growers take pride in their land, their fruit, and their craft. We work closely with them throughout the season, staying involved from the field forward to ensure fruit meets the expectations tied to the Bari® and Logoluso® names.[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]', 'About', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-03-02 06:13:10', '2026-03-02 06:13:10', '', 15, 'https://bariproduce.com/?p=314', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
