imation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" title_font_size_tablet=\"36px\" title_font_size_phone=\"34px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_heading title=\"We are smaller by design, and hands-on by choice.\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h5\" title_font=\"Inter|600|||||||\" title_text_align=\"left\" title_text_color=\"#612228\" title_font_size=\"22px\" custom_margin=\"||0px||false|false\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" title_font_size_tablet=\"22px\" title_font_size_phone=\"20px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" text_font_size=\"18px\" header_text_align=\"center\" custom_margin=\"||17px|||\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93,%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\"]<p>We offer tried-and-true favorites as well as new varieties. Our lineup includes:</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" text_font_size=\"18px\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93,%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\"]<p><strong>Table Grapes</strong> under the BARI® and LOGOLUSO® labels and standards<br /><strong>Stone Fruit</strong> such as peaches, nectarines, plums, pluots, cherries, and pomegranates.<br /><strong>Specialty &amp; Seasonal Varieties</strong> like our popular Crazy Apes™ extra la