imation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" title_font_size_tablet=\"36px\" title_font_size_phone=\"34px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_heading title=\"We are smaller by design, and hands-on by choice.\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h5\" title_font=\"Inter|600|||||||\" title_text_align=\"left\" title_text_color=\"#612228\" title_font_size=\"22px\" custom_margin=\"||0px||false|false\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" title_font_size_tablet=\"22px\" title_font_size_phone=\"20px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" text_font_size=\"18px\" header_text_align=\"center\" custom_margin=\"||17px|||\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93,%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\"]<p>We offer tried-and-true favorites as well as new varieties. Our lineup includes:</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" text_font_size=\"18px\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93,%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\"]<p><strong>Table Grapes</strong> under the BARI® and LOGOLUSO® labels and standards<br /><strong>Stone Fruit</strong> such as peaches, nectarines, plums, pluots, cherries, and pomegranates.<br /><strong>Specialty &amp; Seasonal Varieties</strong> like our popular Crazy Apes™ extra large apricots that are all hand-picked and hand-packed.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_button button_text=\"View All Our Products\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" custom_button=\"on\" button_text_size=\"16px\" button_text_color=\"#FFFFFF\" button_bg_color=\"#612228\" button_border_width=\"2px\" button_border_color=\"#612228\" button_border_radius=\"16px\" button_on_hover=\"off\" transform_translate_linked__hover=\"off\" custom_padding=\"10px|40px|10px|20px|true|false\" animation_style=\"slide\" animation_direction=\"bottom\" animation_intensity_slide=\"8%\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\" button_bg_color__hover=\"#2C470E\" button_bg_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" button_text_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" button_border_color__hover=\"#2C470E\" button_border_color__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" button_bg_enable_color__hover=\"on\" transform_styles__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_scale__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_translate__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_rotate__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_skew__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_origin__hover_enabled=\"on|hover\" transform_translate__hover=\"8px|0px\" button_text_color__hover=\"#FFFFFF\"][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"3_5\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_gallery gallery_ids=\"378,377,382,384\" show_title_and_caption=\"off\" show_pagination=\"off\" zoom_icon_color=\"#FFFFFF\" hover_overlay_color=\"rgba(113,56,62,0.74)\" hover_icon=\"&#x2d;||divi||400\" module_class=\"products-gallery \" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" custom_margin=\"||0px||false|false\" custom_padding=\"||||false|false\" hover_enabled=\"0\" border_radii_image=\"on|12px|12px|12px|12px\" global_colors_info=\"{}\" background__hover_enabled=\"on|desktop\" sticky_enabled=\"0\"][/et_pb_gallery][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row use_custom_gutte