e Bari Produce\" _builder_version=\"4.27.5\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h2\" title_font=\"--et_global_heading_font|--et_global_heading_font_weight|||||||\" title_text_color=\"gcid-heading-color\" title_font_size=\"40px\" custom_margin=\"||10px||false|false\" animation_direction=\"top\" title_font_size_tablet=\"36px\" title_font_size_phone=\"34px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-heading-color%22:%91%22title_text_color%22%93}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_heading title=\"We are smaller by design, and hands-on by choice.\" _builder_version=\"4.27.6\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h5\" title_font=\"Inter|600|||||||\" title_text_align=\"left\" title_text_color=\"#612228\" title_font_size=\"22px\" title_line_height=\"1.4em\" custom_margin=\"||10px||false|false\" title_font_size_tablet=\"22px\" title_font_size_phone=\"20px\" title_font_size_last_edited=\"on|desktop\" locked=\"off\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][/et_pb_heading][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.6\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_text_color=\"gcid-body-color\" animation_direction=\"top\" global_colors_info=\"{%22gcid-body-color%22:%91%22text_text_color%22%93}\"]<p>We’re intentionally structured to stay involved. Orders aren’t passed along anonymously. They’re managed by people who understand fruit, timing, and what’s at stake when product hits the dock.</p>\n<p>We stay close to the field, close to our trusted growers, and accountable through every delivery. That’s how we continue to deliver fruit that is consistent in size, flavor, and appearance - even during busy seasons.</p>\n<p>Ordering is straightforward. Communication is clear. And expectations are met without needing reminders.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_heading title=\"We’re big enough to deliver—and small enough to care.\" _builder_version=\"4.27.6\" _module_preset=\"default\" title_level=\"h5\" title_font=\"Inter|600|||||||\" title_text_align=\"left\" title_text_color=\"#612228\" title_font_s